  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Occupied Palestinian Territories: Explosive Ordnance Risk Reduction and Education (UNMAS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Activity will reduce explosive hazard risks in Gaza and the West Bank by:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;: UNMAS leads coordination of Humanitarian Mine Action in Gaza.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hazard Response&lt;/strong&gt;: UNMAS clears explosive hazards to ensure safe access for humanitarian efforts.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Education&lt;/strong&gt;: UNMAS delivers Explosive Ordnance Risk Education (EORE) to communities.&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity Building&lt;/strong&gt;: UNMAS&#xa0;provides advice to local organisations, and prepares for future efforts in Gaza.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
